From 12e41da3ca4b0d064e6db192c407d803a9ad6875 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Swee Aun Khor <sakhor@efinixinc.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 15:05:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] mmc/host/efx_emmc: support eMMC v1.3

- Add clock shift setting for HS200 and HS400 modes
- Enhance tuning matching conditions
- Improve optimal sample selection during tuning

Signed-off-by: Swee Aun Khor <sakhor@efinixinc.com>
---
